{"assetType":"character_single_image","contentId":"character.seojin.1","contentUsage":"인게임 전투와 캐릭터 선택 화면에서 목표 4.25-head 젊은 성인 실루엣, 열린 먹선, 넓은 여백, 낮은 상투·한쪽 어깨 갑옷·왼쪽 허리 환도를 읽는 단일 전신 이미지","domainType":"character","identityConsistencyLock":{"identityId":"character.seojin.1","referenceFacts":[{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.gender_presentation.v9"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/genderPresentation"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.body.v9"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/body"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.face.v9"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/face"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.hair.v9"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/hair"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.costume.v9"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/costume"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.equipment.v9"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/equipment"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.weapon.v9"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/weapon"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.handedness.v9"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/handedness"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.palette.v9"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/palette"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.materials.v9"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/materials"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.identifying_features.v9"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/identifyingFeatures"}]},"planningSnapshot":{"approvedFacts":[{"factId":"seojin.canonical.single_image_readiness","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/act-plans/player/character.seojin.1.json","sourcePointer":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/readiness","value":"ready"},{"factId":"seojin.canonical.character_id","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/act-plans/player/character.seojin.1.json","sourcePointer":"/identity/characterId","value":"character.seojin.1"},{"factId":"seojin.canonical.character_type","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/act-plans/player/character.seojin.1.json","sourcePointer":"/identity/characterType","value":"Player"},{"factId":"seojin.canonical.runtime_domain","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/act-plans/player/character.seojin.1.json","sourcePointer":"/identity/runtimeDomain","value":"character"},{"factId":"seojin.canonical.planning_status","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/act-plans/player/character.seojin.1.json","sourcePointer":"/planningStatus","value":"approved"},{"factId":"seojin.appearance.body.v9","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v9.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.appearance.body.v9/value","value":{"description":"전신은 4.0–5.0 heads 범위 안에서 목표 4.25 heads로 읽히는 compact but adult 비례를 사용한다. 팔다리는 단순하고 압축하되 젊은 성인 신체로 유지하며 아동형, 6.5–8등신 자연주의 장신 또는 영웅적 해부를 사용하지 않는다."}},{"factId":"seojin.appearance.costume.v9","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v9.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.appearance.costume.v9/value","value":{"description":"빛바랜 군졸복, 회갈색 여행 겉옷과 한쪽 어깨의 수선 반신 갑옷을 조선시대 군졸 출신 떠돌이 검사의 열린 식별 실루엣으로 단순화한다. 예상 외곽·내부 경계의 35–55%를 생략하고 목표 45%로 하며 복식 내부의 넓은 무채색·미채색 여백을 보존한다."}},{"factId":"seojin.appearance.equipment.v9","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v9.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.appearance.equipment.v9/value","value":[{"description":"한쪽 어깨의 수선 반신 갑옷은 dusty gray-brown의 넓고 거친 소량 안료 mass와 끊긴 먹선으로만 식별하며 비늘·리벳·미세질감을 조밀하게 열거하지 않는다."},{"description":"작은 utility pouch 하나는 muted ochre의 작은 accent anchor로만 유지하고, 작은 travel accessory는 dusty gray-brown 보조 anchor로 구분한다."}]},{"factId":"seojin.appearance.face.v9","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v9.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.appearance.face.v9/value","value":{"description":"젊은 성인 한국 남성의 깨끗한 턱선, 곧은 눈썹과 차분한 시선을 소수의 high-signal mok-seon으로 단순화한다. 얼굴 경계를 완전히 닫거나 사실적 모델링·피부 명암·미세질감·아동형 둥근 얼굴로 처리하지 않는다."}},{"factId":"seojin.appearance.gender_presentation.v9","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v9.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.appearance.gender_presentation.v9/value","value":{"description":"20대 중후반의 젊은 성인 한국 남성으로 명확히 읽히는 시각 표현. 미성년·아동처럼 보이지 않으며 조선시대 군졸 출신 떠돌이 검사의 실용적이고 절제된 인상을 유지한다."}},{"factId":"seojin.appearance.hair.v9","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v9.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.appearance.hair.v9/value","value":{"description":"검은 머리를 낮고 단정한 조선식 상투로 묶는다. 상투는 가변 압력의 짙은 먹선과 열린 여백으로 식별되며 불투명 검정 면, 균일한 외곽선 또는 사실적 모발 미세선으로 채우지 않는다."}},{"factId":"seojin.appearance.handedness.v9","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v9.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.appearance.handedness.v9/value","value":"right"},{"factId":"seojin.appearance.identifying_features.v9","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v9.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.appearance.identifying_features.v9/value","value":["4.0–5.0 heads 범위의 목표 4.25-head 젊은 성인 비례","젊은 성인 한국 남성의 단순화된 얼굴과 차분한 시선","낮고 단정한 조선식 상투","한쪽 어깨의 수선 반신 갑옷","왼쪽 허리에 완전히 칼집에 든 조선식 환도와 손잡이에 얹은 오른손"]},{"factId":"seojin.appearance.intended_display.single_image.v9","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v9.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.appearance.intended_display.single_image.v9/value","value":{"assetType":"character_single_image","backgroundPolicy":"transparent","detailDensity":{"description":"예상 외곽·내부 경계의 35–55%를 생략하고 목표 45%로 하며 figure interior와 full canvas 각각 최소 70%를 무채색 또는 미채색 여백으로 유지한다. 안료는 세 역할의 넓고 거친 watercolor/pastel mass만 허용하고 clean cel fill이나 decorative small color dots를 사용하지 않는다.","level":"exact"},"framingPolicy":"centered full-body head-to-toe with generous clear space; no crop","outputUsage":"인게임 전투와 캐릭터 선택 화면에서 목표 4.25-head 젊은 성인 실루엣, 열린 먹선, 넓은 여백, 낮은 상투·한쪽 어깨 갑옷·왼쪽 허리 환도를 읽는 단일 전신 이미지","providerCanvasPolicy":"profile_owned_technical_canvas","targetDisplaySize":{"consumerViewportOrReference":"인게임 전투 카메라와 캐릭터 선택 화면에서 전신 높이 96~144px로 표시되는 단일 캐릭터 이미지","minimumPixelSize":{"height":96,"width":64},"targetPixelSize":{"height":144,"width":96},"unit":"px"}}},{"factId":"seojin.appearance.materials.v9","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v9.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.appearance.materials.v9/value","value":[{"appliesTo":"얼굴·상투·복식·한쪽 어깨 갑옷·오른손과 왼쪽 허리 환도의 열린 식별 경계","materialDescription":"pressure-variable tactile mok-seon with visible brush start, directional drag, dry end, and directional weight"},{"appliesTo":"승인된 faded blue-gray/indigo, dusty gray-brown, small muted-ochre palette anchors only","materialDescription":"broad rough watercolor and rough pastel masses with controlled bleed and controlled misalignment beyond the contour"}]},{"factId":"seojin.appearance.palette.v9","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v9.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.appearance.palette.v9/value","value":[{"appliesTo":"군졸복의 목깃과 허리·띠, 칼집에 든 환도 손잡이의 제한된 primary cool broad marks","colorDescription":"faded blue-gray/indigo"},{"appliesTo":"여행 겉옷, 한쪽 어깨 수선 반신 갑옷과 small travel accessory의 제한된 secondary earth broad marks","colorDescription":"dusty gray-brown"},{"appliesTo":"small utility pouch와 선택된 작은 수선 지점에만 쓰는 small warm accent","colorDescription":"muted ochre"}]},{"factId":"seojin.appearance.pose_policy.single_image.v9","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v9.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.appearance.pose_policy.single_image.v9/value","value":{"description":"Natural front three-quarter full-body stance, neutral but ready to move, with the right hand resting lightly on the hilt of the fully sheathed hwando at the left waist; one viewpoint only.","mode":"exact"}},{"factId":"seojin.appearance.weapon.v9","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v9.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.appearance.weapon.v9/value","value":{"description":"오른손잡이용 장식 없는 조선식 환도 한 자루를 왼쪽 허리에 완전히 칼집에 둔다. 오른손은 손잡이에 가볍게 얹고, 칼집과 손잡이는 열린 가변압 먹선과 제한된 faded indigo 또는 dusty gray-brown anchor로 읽히며 사실적 금속·장식 미세선을 사용하지 않는다.","present":true}},{"factId":"seojin.single_image.expression_profile_key.v9","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v9.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.single_image.expression_profile_key.v9/value","value":"projectbs_character_open_ink_wash_dynamic_contour@1.0.0"},{"factId":"seojin.single_image.identity_consistency_lock.v9","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v9.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.single_image.identity_consistency_lock.v9/value","value":{"identityId":"character.seojin.1","referenceFacts":[{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.gender_presentation.v9"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/genderPresentation"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.body.v9"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/body"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.face.v9"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/face"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.hair.v9"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/hair"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.costume.v9"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/costume"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.equipment.v9"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/equipment"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.weapon.v9"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/weapon"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.handedness.v9"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/handedness"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.palette.v9"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/palette"},{